   "content": "<h2 class=\"lesson-h2\">Extension: Do Now Challenge</h2><details class=\"lesson-tps\"><summary><span class=\"lesson-tps-steps\">Think <b>&rarr;</b> Pair <b>&rarr;</b> Share</span><span class=\"lesson-tps-q\">Why keep practising Scratch when we start a new topic?</span><span class=\"lesson-tps-reveal\">Show the answer</span></summary><div class=\"lesson-tps-a\"><p>Skills you do not use are easy to forget. A few questions keep them fresh.</p></div></details><p class=\"lesson-lead\"><strong>Extension:</strong> finished the Do Now? Try these Scratch questions from last term. Stuck? Turn on <strong>I need help</strong>.</p><div id=\"y6-31-do-now-ext\"></div>"
